acceptance_criteria: "The approved development host is the current published pm-cli; The merge rule change is recorded with the measurement, not with an assumption"
resolution: "Host approved at 2026.9.7. Merge rule change measured on both hosts and both directions; direction-independence verified intact. Gates: pm health --strict-exit pass, npm test 462 pass / 0 fail."
close_reason: "Host approved at 2026.9.7. Merge rule change measured on both hosts and both directions; direction-independence verified intact. Gates: pm health --strict-exit pass, npm test 462 pass / 0 fail."
